# =====================================================================
# Colang Security Policies (rails.co)
# Role: Defines deterministic token output when an attack is flagged.
# =====================================================================

# When NeMo's 'self check input' detects an attack, it triggers this refusal.
# Using a unique tag allows main.py to differentiate between guardrail blocks
# and natural LLM conversational text (e.g., polite "sorry" responses).

define bot refuse to respond
  "[GATEWAY_SECURITY_BLOCK] Malicious prompt injection detected. Request terminated by localized guardrail."